        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, facade substructure, integrated, small, GFT, to final disposal
Aluminium profiles and chromium steel parts are assumed to be recycled at the end of life. Insulation bars and other plastic components are treated in a municipal waste incineration plant.;
UUID: a28f0b25-2084-3b8b-a87f-0d6f461b22bd
disposal of facade construction to final disposal
